      "source": "Copyright © 2005 - <script>var d = new Date();\n        document.write(d.getFullYear());</script> Broadcom. All Rights Reserved. The term \"Broadcom\" refers to Broadcom Inc. and/or its subsidiaries.<br/><a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/legal.html\">Terms of Use</a> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Privacy</a> • <a href=\"https://spring.io/trademarks\">Trademark Guidelines</a> <span id=\"thank-you-mobile\">• <a href=\"https://spring.io/thank-you\">Thank you</a></span> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy/california-privacy-rights.html\">Your California Privacy Rights</a> • <a class=\"ot-sdk-show-settings\">Cookie Settings</a> <span id=\"teconsent\"></span>",
      "translation": "版权所有 © 2005 - <script>var d = new Date(); document.write(d.getFullYear());</script> Broadcom。保留所有权利。“Broadcom”指 Broadcom Inc. 及其/或其子公司。<br/><a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/legal.html\">使用条款</a> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">隐私政策</a> • <a href=\"https://spring.io/trademarks\">商标指南</a> <span id=\"thank-you-mobile\">• <a href=\"https://spring.io/thank-you\">致谢</a></span> • <a href=\"https://www.vmware.com/help/privacy/california-privacy-rights.html\">您的加州隐私权利</a> • <a class=\"ot-sdk-show-settings\">Cookie 设置</a> <span id=\"teconsent\"></span>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>CqlTemplate</code> class (and its asynchronous and reactive variants) offers various methods accepting static CQL, <code>Statement</code> objects and <code>PreparedStatementCreator</code>.\nMethods accepting static CQL without additional arguments typically run the CQL statement as-is without further processing.\nMethods accepting static CQL in combination with an arguments array (such as <code>execute(String cql, Object…​ args)</code> and <code>queryForRows(String cql, Object…​ args)</code>) use prepared statements.\nInternally, these methods create a <code>PreparedStatementCreator</code> and <code>PreparedStatementBinder</code> objects to prepare the statement and later on to bind values to the statement to run it.\nSpring Data Cassandra generally uses index-based parameter bindings for prepared statements.",
      "translation": "`CqlTemplate` 类（及其异步和响应式变体）提供了多种接受静态 CQL、`Statement` 对象以及 `PreparedStatementCreator` 的方法。  \n接受不带额外参数的静态 CQL 的方法通常直接执行该 CQL 语句，不再进行进一步处理。  \n接受静态 CQL 并结合参数数组的方法（例如 `execute(String cql, Object…​ args)` 和 `queryForRows(String cql, Object…​ args)`）则使用预编译语句。  \n内部地，这些方法会创建 `PreparedStatementCreator` 和 `PreparedStatementBinder` 对象，用于准备语句，并在稍后将值绑定到该语句以执行它。  \nSpring Data Cassandra 通常对预编译语句采用基于索引的参数绑定方式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The <code>CassandraTemplate</code> class is built on top of <code>CqlTemplate</code> to provide a higher level of abstraction.\nThe use of prepared statements can be controlled directly on <code>CassandraTemplate</code> (and its asynchronous and reactive variants) by calling <code>setUsePreparedStatements(false)</code> respective <code>setUsePreparedStatements(true)</code>.\nNote that the use of prepared statements by <code>CassandraTemplate</code> is enabled by default.",
      "translation": "`CassandraTemplate` 类构建在 `CqlTemplate` 之上，以提供更高级别的抽象。  \n可以通过调用 `setUsePreparedStatements(false)` 或 `setUsePreparedStatements(true)` 直接在 `CassandraTemplate`（及其异步和响应式变体）上控制预编译语句的使用。  \n请注意，`CassandraTemplate` 默认启用预编译语句的使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Calling entity-bound methods such as <code>select(Query, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code> or <code>update(Query, Update, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code> build CQL statements themselves to perform the intended operations.\nSome <code>CassandraTemplate</code> methods (such as <code>select(Statement&lt;?&gt;, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code>) also accepts CQL <code>Statement</code> objects as part of their API.",
      "translation": "调用绑定到实体的方法，例如<code>select(Query, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code>或<code>update(Query, Update, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code>，会自行构建 CQL 语句以执行预期操作。  \n一些<code>CassandraTemplate</code>方法（如<code>select(Statement&lt;?&gt;, Class&lt;T&gt;)</code>）在其 API 中也接受 CQL <code>Statement</code>对象作为参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"cql-template.html\"><code>CqlTemplate</code>, <code>AsyncCqlTemplate</code>, or <code>ReactiveCqlTemplate</code></a> through the choice of API",
      "translation": "通过选择 API，使用<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"cql-template.html\"><code>CqlTemplate</code>、<code>AsyncCqlTemplate</code>或<code>ReactiveCqlTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"template.html\"><code>CassandraTemplate</code>, <code>AsyncCassandraTemplate</code>, or <code>ReactiveCassandraTemplate</code></a> by enabling prepared statements",
      "translation": "通过启用预编译语句，使用<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"template.html\"><code>CassandraTemplate</code>、<code>AsyncCassandraTemplate</code>或<code>ReactiveCassandraTemplate</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "It’s possible to participate in prepared statements when calling methods accepting a <code>Statement</code> with a <code>SimpleStatement</code> object.\nThe template API extracts the query string and parameters (positional and named parameters) and uses these to prepare, bind, and run the statement.\nNon-<code>SimpleStatement</code> objects cannot be used with prepared statements.",
      "translation": "使用 <code>SimpleStatement</code> 对象调用接受 <code>Statement</code> 的方法时，可以参与预编译语句。模板 API 会提取查询字符串和参数（位置参数和命名参数），并利用这些内容来准备、绑定和执行该语句。非 <code>SimpleStatement</code> 对象无法与预编译语句一起使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "CQL statements that are executed multiple times can be prepared and stored in a <code>PreparedStatement</code> object to improve query performance.\nBoth, the driver and Cassandra maintain a mapping of <code>PreparedStatement</code> queries to their metadata.\nYou can use prepared statements through the following abstractions:",
      "translation": "多次执行的 CQL 语句可以准备并存储在 `<code>PreparedStatement</code>` 对象中，以提升查询性能。\n驱动程序和 Cassandra 都会维护 `<code>PreparedStatement</code>` 查询与其元数据之间的映射关系。\n您可以通过以下抽象使用预编译语句：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "In cases where you require more control over statement preparation and parameter binding (for example, using named binding parameters), you can fully control prepared statement creation and parameter binding by calling query methods with <code>PreparedStatementCreator</code> and <code>PreparedStatementBinder</code> arguments:",
      "translation": "在需要更灵活地控制语句准备和参数绑定（例如使用命名绑定参数）的情况下，您可以通过调用带有 `<code>PreparedStatementCreator</code>` 和 `<code>PreparedStatementBinder</code>` 参数的查询方法来完全控制预编译语句的创建和参数绑定：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Since Cassandra driver 4.0, prepared statements are cached by the <code>CqlSession</code> cache so it is okay to prepare the same string twice.\nPrevious versions required caching of prepared statements outside of the driver.\nSee also the <a href=\"https://docs.datastax.com/en/developer/java-driver/latest/manual/core/statements/prepared/\">Driver documentation on Prepared Statements</a> for further reference.",
      "translation": "自 Cassandra 驱动 4.0 版本起，<code>CqlSession</code> 缓存会缓存预编译语句，因此重复准备相同的字符串是安全的。\n之前的版本需要在驱动外部对预编译语句进行缓存。\n有关更多参考信息，请参阅<a href=\"https://docs.datastax.com/en/developer/java-driver/latest/manual/core/statements/prepared/\">驱动程序关于预编译语句的文档</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories.html\">Cassandra repositories</a> as they are built on top of the Template API",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"../repositories.html\">Cassandra 存储库</a>，因为它们构建在模板 API 之上。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Spring Data Cassandra ships with classes supporting that pattern in the <code>cql</code> package:",
      "translation": "Spring Data Cassandra 在 <code>cql</code> 包中提供了支持该模式的类：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>SimplePreparedStatementCreator</code> - utility class to create a prepared statement.",
      "translation": "<code>SimplePreparedStatementCreator</code> - 用于创建预编译语句的工具类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ArgumentPreparedStatementBinder</code> - utility class to bind arguments to a prepared statement.",
      "translation": "ArgumentPreparedStatementBinder - 用于将参数绑定到预编译语句的工具类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Since Cassandra Driver version 4, prepared statements are cached on the driver level which removes the need to keep track of prepared statements in the application.",
      "translation": "自 Cassandra 驱动程序版本 4 起，已准备语句在驱动层面进行缓存，从而消除了应用程序中跟踪已准备语句的需要。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows how to issue a query with a parametrized prepared statement:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了如何使用参数化预编译语句发出查询：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The following example shows the use of methods that generate and that accept CQL:",
      "translation": "以下示例展示了生成和接受 CQL 的方法的使用：",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
